Unified Buffer

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Unified Buffer is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for governing
allocation, ownership, mapping, sharing, pooling, reuse, residency, and
lifecycle across heterogeneous memory domains.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Unified Buffer does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Unified Buffer accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See docs/CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
